{"4135120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Speed Rivals - Model Trains", "steam_appid": 4135120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Railway Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, customize, and bring your own maps to life with a powerful railway editor. Design unique track layouts with elevations, banked curves, crossings, junctions, and any combination you can imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings for loading, unloading, stations, and other railway operations, then shape the world around them with decorations, nature, environments, structures, signs, and details that make every map feel alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/652c9d4e2a12d6464e614230c13e0464.poster.avif?t=1786272916\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/652c9d4e2a12d6464e614230c13e0464.webm?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/652c9d4e2a12d6464e614230c13e0464.mp4?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple to Drive, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving the train is easy to understand, but mastering it is another story. As you move across the map, you will need to make quick decisions: switch tracks, control your speed, reverse when needed, and use the map view to plan the fastest route ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed matters, but so does control. Your locomotive type, wagon count, cargo weight, and current speed all affect how safely you can take each turn. Push too hard and you may derail, and nobody wants that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/decfa6bf96f1326aa3322aaf28c4d6b9.poster.avif?t=1786272916\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/decfa6bf96f1326aa3322aaf28c4d6b9.webm?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/decfa6bf96f1326aa3322aaf28c4d6b9.mp4?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take on Delivery Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with delivery missions made up of different tasks. You will be told what cargo you need, how many wagons are required, and where everything needs to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions may ask for several wagon types in different quantities, and as you progress, routes become more complex, deliveries spread across multiple locations, and planning becomes just as important as speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/8ecb96f38d5177946eb9be02439e0961.poster.avif?t=1786272916\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/8ecb96f38d5177946eb9be02439e0961.webm?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/8ecb96f38d5177946eb9be02439e0961.mp4?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is more fun with other players. Team up in cooperative mode and work together to complete the same mission as fast as possible, coordinating routes, cargo, and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or jump into competitive mode and go head-to-head to prove who is the fastest driver. Race for the best route, outsmart your rivals, and maybe even leave a few surprises on the tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/5a10fce4413cab9489ce1f96221da7a1.poster.avif?t=1786272916\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/5a10fce4413cab9489ce1f96221da7a1.webm?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/5a10fce4413cab9489ce1f96221da7a1.mp4?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Railway Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, customize, and bring your own maps to life with a powerful railway editor. Design unique track layouts with elevations, banked curves, crossings, junctions, and any combination you can imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings for loading, unloading, stations, and other railway operations, then shape the world around them with decorations, nature, environments, structures, signs, and details that make every map feel alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/652c9d4e2a12d6464e614230c13e0464.poster.avif?t=1786272916\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/652c9d4e2a12d6464e614230c13e0464.webm?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/652c9d4e2a12d6464e614230c13e0464.mp4?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple to Drive, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving the train is easy to understand, but mastering it is another story. As you move across the map, you will need to make quick decisions: switch tracks, control your speed, reverse when needed, and use the map view to plan the fastest route ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed matters, but so does control. Your locomotive type, wagon count, cargo weight, and current speed all affect how safely you can take each turn. Push too hard and you may derail, and nobody wants that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/decfa6bf96f1326aa3322aaf28c4d6b9.poster.avif?t=1786272916\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/decfa6bf96f1326aa3322aaf28c4d6b9.webm?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/decfa6bf96f1326aa3322aaf28c4d6b9.mp4?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take on Delivery Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with delivery missions made up of different tasks. You will be told what cargo you need, how many wagons are required, and where everything needs to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions may ask for several wagon types in different quantities, and as you progress, routes become more complex, deliveries spread across multiple locations, and planning becomes just as important as speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/8ecb96f38d5177946eb9be02439e0961.poster.avif?t=1786272916\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/8ecb96f38d5177946eb9be02439e0961.webm?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/8ecb96f38d5177946eb9be02439e0961.mp4?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is more fun with other players. Team up in cooperative mode and work together to complete the same mission as fast as possible, coordinating routes, cargo, and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or jump into competitive mode and go head-to-head to prove who is the fastest driver. Race for the best route, outsmart your rivals, and maybe even leave a few surprises on the tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/5a10fce4413cab9489ce1f96221da7a1.poster.avif?t=1786272916\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/5a10fce4413cab9489ce1f96221da7a1.webm?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135120/extras/5a10fce4413cab9489ce1f96221da7a1.mp4?t=1786272916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Build wild railway worlds, master fast and risky train driving, complete chaotic delivery missions, and race or cooperate with friends in a multiplayer train game where every track, wagon, and second matters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, J